# `endofday` with an offset whose `offset + 1` overflows `i64` is DS4003.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project d = endofday(timestamp, 9223372036854775807)
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `endofday` does not fit in a `datetime`
  --> query:3:15
  |
3 | | project d = endofday(timestamp, 9223372036854775807)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: datetimes and timespans are counted in microseconds and hold about ±292,000 years
